      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "A permission of [`AVAudioSession.RecordPermission.undetermined`](avaudiosession/recordpermission-swift.enum/undetermined.md) typically means that your app hasn’t requested, or is in the process of requesting, recording permission.",
